# GNN training artifacts (Design/11 §8): ignore the regenerable graph cache
# under data/ml/cache (incident_*.pt, features.json, splits.json) but KEEP the
# trained-model run directories (data/ml/cache/runs/) tracked.
# NOTE: ignore the directory *contents* (/*), not the directory itself —
# git cannot re-include files under a wholly-ignored directory path.
data/ml/cache/*
!data/ml/cache/runs/
